Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:20.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:20.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}高芙 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁷ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 米拉·安德烈耶娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You know how to thrill Arthur Ashe Stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最懂怎么点燃阿瑟·阿什球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and you gave us another example
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你又演了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,给所有人看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,First set was a little bit scratchy by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,以你的标准 第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,your standards and you continued to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得有点糙 但你一直在拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你从没放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the key besides
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,除了意志力之外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,the mental effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the key to being able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,能把这场球翻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to turn this match around?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,靠的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I just had to reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我就是得重启一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I came out not feeling the ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,开场我完全找不到球感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,giving her too many free points,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,白送了她太多分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Mirra was playing a great level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,米拉打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that I think in the restroom, honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以在洗手间里 说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:36.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就老实说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about Frances Tiafoe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时在想蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and how he came back yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,想他昨天是怎么翻盘的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:47.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So, and we all want to do well in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都想在这样的主场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出点样子来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So, honestly, I was just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以说实话 我只想着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to literally leave the court with no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,离开球场的时候不留遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how the outcome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道结果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,会是什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but really, really, really thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但真的真的太谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.84,EN,,0,0,0,,that she really helped me pull this one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们真的把我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:00.84,EN,,0,0,0,,through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Throughout the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,整场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,we saw you look at your team to try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们看到你一直看向团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to drum up some emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,想把情绪调动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,After the match, you looked at your team
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后你看着你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and you said that was all heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说了一句 全靠一颗心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,How important are the people in your box
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,包厢里那些人有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to be able to come through a match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,能让你在状态不好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when you weren't playing your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是把比赛拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,太重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I know sometimes I give them a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道我有时候对他们很凶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:25.28,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm just stressed out, I need to look
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,当我紧张到不行的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,over and not see them stressed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我需要看过去 看到他们不慌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,even though they might be stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕他们其实也在紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I think the motto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这场球的座右铭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match is just to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是一个字 拼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, thank you guys for the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们给我的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Sorry for what was said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说过的那些话 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think they're too tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们大概太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:41.88,EN,,0,0,0,,JC can't even stand up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,JC 已经站都站不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:43.84,EN,,0,0,0,,A thrilling match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场惊心动魄的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Saving match points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,救下赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You're through to the semifinals again here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又一次闯进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't get easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且接下来不会更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You face Elena Rybakina in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,半决赛你要碰莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:58.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I know you just finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你刚打完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'd love your first initial thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但很想听听你的第一反应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean Elena, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,she's a new world number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是新科世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so it's going to be a tough match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以会是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Last time we played,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,it was a tough three setter for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得很苦 打满了三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm I'm looking forward to the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很期待这一战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,These are the moments you live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是你活着要等的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for and I'm I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll see you guys tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天晚上见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You're looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,The fans are looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,球迷们也很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:21.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the semifinals of the US Open,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,再一次闯进美网半决赛
